# P4c receipt: one Stage scene drives both graph views and real interaction.
#
# Major and Major 7 carry the sequence relation plus several computed catalog
# relations. The receipt activates one routed cell and drags one rendered node
# through the host pointer queue before collapsing the same scene projection.

log P4c: Stage scene canvas, relation activation, and node drag
settle 3

act stage-related-pair
settle 3
assert snap set-cards == 2
assert snap tray-expanded == true
assert snap graph-nodes == 2
assert snap graph-relations >= 3
capture 01_expanded_fanned_relations

click-stage-relation 0
settle 2
assert snap graph-selected-relation == true
capture 02_relation_activated

drag-stage-node 0 110 -28
settle 3
assert snap graph-moved-nodes == 1
assert snap set-cards == 2
assert snap graph-nodes == 2
capture 03_node_dragged

act collapse-tray
settle 3
assert snap tray-expanded == false
assert snap graph-nodes == 2
assert snap graph-relations >= 3
assert snap graph-selected-relation == false
assert snap graph-moved-nodes == 1
capture 04_compact_same_scene

log P4c receipt complete
